{
  "about": "The playback model of v0.5.2 (#495 UX-10, the architect's design playback-model-v0.5.2): one case per rule, written by hand. tests/web/playback-model.test.mjs runs it on Scripts/playback/playback-model.ts and PlaybackPositionTests.swift on PlaybackModel. Ticks at 480 a quarter; a selection is [start, end). A case with an event gives the engine's steps and the state once the engine has them; 'view' is what the views draw from that state, or from 'given' when there is no event.",
